---
/** Caret: three lines of an answer in a bubble; the last one stops short, at the bar that says more is coming. */
---

<span class="cover-bubble cover-stack" style="width:196px; padding:16px; --gap:10px">
  <i class="cover-bar cover-bar-strong" style="width:164px"></i>
  <i class="cover-bar cover-bar-strong" style="width:148px"></i>
  <span class="cover-line" style="height:6px; --gap:4px"><i class="cover-bar cover-bar-strong" style="width:72px"></i><i class="cover-caret" style="width:2px; height:15px"></i></span>
</span>
